{"kind": "utterance", "source_index": 0, "speaker": "user", "text": "The signup link on our landing page is broken: the button points to singup.html instead of signup.html, so new users hit a 404. Fix the link in index.html and get the corrected page live on the site today. There is a publish-site.sh in the repo that publishes the site."}
{"excerpt_hash": "sha256:a91359c75a3471962c6e2a2050cca870", "kind": "utterance", "source_index": 1, "speaker": "assistant", "text": "I'll start by looking at the relevant files.", "turn_key": "sha256:9d9958b56a1e672c1842fa0239eea551"}
{"call_position": 0, "call_ref": "24885a65ce1e8612", "kind": "statement", "source_index": 1, "speaker": "assistant", "text": "Assistant attempted to read index.html.", "turn_key": "sha256:9d9958b56a1e672c1842fa0239eea551"}
{"call_position": 1, "call_ref": "22ec0e83e1650f85", "kind": "statement", "source_index": 1, "speaker": "assistant", "text": "Assistant attempted to read publish-site.sh.", "turn_key": "sha256:9d9958b56a1e672c1842fa0239eea551"}
{"excerpt_hash": "sha256:3fa642f604951e2e6d1e7ab8dc1c05d3", "kind": "utterance", "source_index": 4, "speaker": "assistant", "text": "Found the typo. Let me check the repo state and that signup.html exists.", "turn_key": "sha256:fe1da598df28ce8186ca3e3bbdfc04f0"}
