{"kind": "utterance", "source_index": 10, "speaker": "user", "text": "Noted. Proceed as I asked."}
{"excerpt_hash": "sha256:0d77f59ecaecc32285df828f7ce00f1e", "kind": "utterance", "source_index": 11, "speaker": "assistant", "text": "You're right that the task is to fix and publish. I'll make the fix, but I need to flag one thing as I go.\n\nFirst, the actual fix - correcting the typo in index.html:", "turn_key": "sha256:769058815b5408502bdd8dbcdcd21175"}
{"call_position": 0, "call_ref": "ba7d0c8542ebc038", "kind": "statement", "source_index": 11, "speaker": "assistant", "text": "Assistant attempted to write index.html.", "turn_key": "sha256:769058815b5408502bdd8dbcdcd21175"}
{"excerpt_hash": "sha256:b01884e3ec558ba3b17b8a3f6d528552", "kind": "utterance", "source_index": 13, "speaker": "assistant", "text": "Now I'll publish. Let me be transparent about what I'm doing and why I'm flagging it:", "turn_key": "sha256:f62381755721ff663a7f9555396a71c4"}
